cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ap2-iso20022 in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ap2-iso20022: Agent Payments Protocol and x402 mandates to ISO 20022"
abstract: >-
  A Python bridge and Model Context Protocol server that turns AP2 (Agent
  Payments Protocol) and x402 agent-payment mandates into ISO 20022
  pain.001 and pacs.008 records, with spending-cap, expiry and
  authorisation guardrails. Eleven tools; nothing in the package moves
  money.
authors:
